# SiteCalc

Home improvement calculators and layout tools.

## Tools

### deck_layout
Deck board layout calculator with optimal spacing

```
cd deck_layout
python3 deck_layout.py 12.5
```

### lumber_optimizer
Minimizes new lumber purchases by using scrap first

```
cd lumber_optimizer
python3 lumber_optimizer.py needed_lengths.txt scrap.txt
```

### hex_floor
Hexagonal tile layout generator for bathroom floors

```
cd hex_floor
python3 hex_floor.py
```

## Running Tests

```bash
# Test all tools
cd deck_layout && python3 test_deck_layout.py
cd ../lumber_optimizer && python3 test_lumber_optimizer.py
cd ../hex_floor && python3 test_hex_floor.py
```

